</PRE>
<H2>DESCRIPTION</H2><PRE>
     Delivers a command to a message based device.



</PRE>
<H2>RETURNS</H2><PRE>
     See <B>epvxiMsgLib(1)</B> for a description  of  the  return  codes
     from this library.


</PRE>
<H2>SEE ALSO</H2><PRE>
     <B>epvxiMsgLib(1)</B>, <B>epvxiLib(1)</B>


































</PRE>
<H2>NAME</H2><PRE>
     epvxiQuery - fetch a response from a message based device


</PRE>
<H2>SYNOPSIS</H2><PRE>
