</PRE>
<H2>RETURNS</H2><PRE>
     See <B>epvxiMsgLib(1)</B> for a description  of  the  returns  from
     this library.


</PRE>
<H2>SEE ALSO</H2><PRE>
     <B>epvxiMsgLib(1)</B>, <B>epvxiLib(1)</B>


































</PRE>
